  "title": "Integrate New Relic and Jira - Bathroom planner",
  "url": "https://i-p-e-x.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=36115316737",
  "content": "<h2>Integration between Jira and New Relic</h2><p>The integration is done via API token generated for Atlassian account.</p><p>Goal is to have a team managed integration between New Relic and Jira. The service account should only have access to the relevant projects in Jira. Probably would be nice to have system user creating issues as well.</p><p>Decision to use personal API token for POC,  <ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"jira\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"dc71d317-30af-4fa1-8249-aaef72b015e7\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"server\">System JIRA</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"serverId\">70cd962b-65cc-357d-b445-58d5af5f9e17</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"key\">PE-1203</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro> </p><p /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"drawio\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"55691660-1db7-459a-befd-aac0e7748499\" ac:macro-id=\"e6257cf7-1111-42ff-b618-7f7945f2eeb0\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"zoom\">1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"simple\">0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"inComment\">0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"pageId\">36115316737</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"custContentId\">36263330049</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"lbox\">1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"diagramDisplayName\">nr_jira_dora.drawio</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"contentVer\">1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"revision\">1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"baseUrl\">https://i-p-e-x.atlassian.net/wiki</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"diagramName\">nr_jira_dora.drawio</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"pCenter\">0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"width\">736.5</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"height\">443.8733333333333</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"links\" /><ac:parameter ac:name=\"tbstyle\" /></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"drawio\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"e84efc9f-598b-4b7f-b831-075336d736ab\" ac:macro-id=\"ac1784c1-6ad7-40a7-b815-7c75e7c98a39\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"mVer\">2</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"zoom\">1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"simple\">0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"inComment\">0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"pageId\">36115316737</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"custContentId\">36309139889</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"lbox\">1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"diagramDisplayName\">flow-chart.drawio</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"contentVer\">2</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"revision\">2</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"baseUrl\">https://i-p-e-x.atlassian.net/wiki</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"diagramName\">flow-chart.drawio</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"pCenter\">0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"width\">431</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"height\">491</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"links\" /><ac:parameter ac:name=\"tbstyle\" /></ac:structured-macro><p /><h2>Definition of MTTR</h2><p>We use Defect with Priority Highest as definition for issues that affect, </p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"jira\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"full-width\" ac:local-id=\"2d06cef3-656c-427c-976b-2e9bcb218c2b\" ac:macro-id=\"9be76bb7-2073-4214-be47-43e6633ac250\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"server\">System JIRA</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"jqlQuery\">project = &quot;Bathroom V2&quot; AND issuetype = Defect AND priority = Highest ORDER BY Rank ASC</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"serverId\">70cd962b-65cc-357d-b445-58d5af5f9e17</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro><h2>Definition of CFR </h2><p>Currently we use the same definition as for MTTR to define CFRs. <ac:link><ri:user ri:account-id=\"6001aa891051d10075f532f9\" /></ac:link> will talk to team and see what alternative we could use to create more data for CFRs so that metric becomes usable.</p><p /><h2>Jira integration - Draft</h2><h3>System user tokens</h3><table data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"944e0f02-a074-48f3-8c76-be901486575e\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Pros</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Const</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><ul><li><p>Security</p></li><li><p>Easy to implement with existing AAD system users</p></li></ul></td><td><ul><li><p>Cost (each system user is a Jira user license)</p></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Personal user tokens</h3><table data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"308b600f-057f-41a1-a10c-b1d3d6793c06\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Pros</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Const</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><ul><li><p>Cost</p></li><li><p>Security</p></li></ul></td><td><ul><li><p>Easy to loose when people leave the team</p></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Single system user</h3><table data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"845d8972-a524-4a30-a9cb-eef1d63cac13\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Pros</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Const</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><ul><li><p>Cost</p></li></ul></td><td><ul><li><p>Security</p></li><li><p>Who should manage it?</p></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Jira Service Desk</h3><table data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"d2c5c78f-9577-448b-ab17-63e74dda1859\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Pros</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Const</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><ul><li><p>Cost</p></li><li><p>Security</p></li></ul></td><td><ul><li><p>Jira SD required + Jira automation (cost?)</p></li><li><p>Overengineering</p></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>",
